{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/4478c5c4c64a9e8d8628655fb743a15c.avif?t=1768693243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/4478c5c4c64a9e8d8628655fb743a15c.webp?t=1768693243 width=1560 height=884 /></span><strong>When night awakens, survival begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of creatures crawl from the shadows \u2014 and you stand alone between light and darkness.<br>In <strong>Umbra Survivors</strong>, you face endless waves of the night, gather power, and unleash cursed artifacts.<br>Each level-up is a moment of tension and reward \u2014 choose wisely, shape your build, and dive deeper into the Umbra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Endless Action-Roguelike Combat</strong> \u2013 fight thousands of enemies in fast-paced, run-based battles.<br>\u2022 <strong>Dynamic Upgrade System</strong> \u2013 weapons, passives, and artifacts that change every run.<br>\u2022 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly Visuals</strong> \u2013 dark fantasy meets clean forms and glowing chaos.<br>\u2022 <strong>Procedural Progression</strong> \u2013 no two runs are the same; adapt or perish.<br>\u2022 <strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 survive longer, grow stronger, and uncover new layers of Umbra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>How long can you defy the night before it consumes you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Umbra Survivors</i> \u2013 Awaken in the dark. Fight. Grow. Survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108600?t=1768693243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/e3649671b799481ea99ada97af68e36c32597d5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768693243","capsule_image":"https